OL,3,GNEWSADriver arrested after motorcyclist
OL,4,Adies in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fcausing death by careless driving
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash involving a car and a
OL,9,Fmotorcycle in East Yorkshire.
OL,11,FThe incident happened on Longdales Lane
OL,12,Fin Ganstead, East Yorkshire, at about
OL,13,F09:15 BST on Wednesday.
OL,15,FA white Mini Cooper was travelling
OL,16,Fsouthbound when it was involved in a
OL,17,Fcollision with a red Honda motorcycle
OL,18,Ftravelling in the opposite direction,
OL,19,Fnear the junction leading to the golf
OL,20,Fcourse.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
